#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.FOODDEHYDRATOR.EFFECT
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.FOODDEHYDRATOR.EFFECT"
msgid ""
"Uses low, even heat to eliminate moisture from eligible <link=\"FOOD\">Foods</link> and render them "
"shelf-stable.\n"
"\n"
"Dehydrated meals must be processed at the <link=\"FOODREHYDRATOR\">Rehydrator</link> before they "
"can be eaten."
msgstr ""
"Usa calor baixo e uniforme para eliminar a umidade de <link='FOOD'>Alimentos</link> elegíveis, "
"tornando-os estáveis para armazenamento.\"\n"
"\n"
"Refeições desidratadas precisam ser processadas no <link='FOODREHYDRATOR'>Reidratador</link> antes "
"de serem consumidas."

