"Crushes organic materials to extract liquids such as <link=\"MILK\">Brackene</link> or "
"<link=\"PHYTOOIL\">Phyto Oil</link>.\n"
"\n"
"<link=\"MILK\">Brackene</link> can be used to refill the <link=\"MILKFEEDER\">Critter Fountain</"
"link>."
