msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.A7_NEWEMPLOYEE.BODY.CONTAINER2"
msgid ""
"<indent=5%>Attention Gravitas Facility personnel;\n"
"\n"
"Please welcome our newest staff member, Olivia Broussard, PhD.\n"
"\n"
"Dr. Broussard will be leading our upcoming genetics project and has been installed in our "
"bioengineering department.\n"
"\n"
"Be sure to offer her our warmest welcome.</indent>"
msgstr ""
"<indent=5%>Atenção Empregados do Instituto Gravitas;\n"
"\n"
"Por favor, deem as boas vindas à nossa mais nova funcionária, Olivia Broussard, PhD.\n"
"\n"
"Dra. Broussard estará liderando nossos novos projetos de genética e ela estará no nosso "
"departamento de bioengenharia.\n"
"\n"
"Por favor, certifiquem-se de dar a ela as nossas calorosas boas-vindas.</indent>"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.A7_NEWEMPLOYEE.BODY.EMAILHEADER1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.A7_NEWEMPLOYEE.BODY.EMAILHEADER1"
msgid ""
