msgid ""
"An extremely powerful medication created to treat severe <link=\"DISEASE\">Diseases</link>. "
"<link=\"ADVANCEDCURE\">Serum Vial</link> is very effective against <link=\"ZOMBIESPORES\">Zombie "
"Spores</link>.\n"
"\n"
"Must be administered by a Duplicant with the <link=\"MEDICINE3\">Advanced Medical Care</link> Skill."
