"maintain a P.E.G.G.Y. crew of eight (8) units.\n"
"\n"
"Engineer will catalog all Project [REDACTED] debris.\n"
"\n"
"All proprietary equipment to be returned to Facility grounds for investigation. Organic and "
"biohazardous debris may be disposed of onsite at Engineer's discretion.\n"
"\n"
"Candidate: Dr. E. Gossmann\n"
"\n"
"Scope of cleanup area: [REDACTED] sq mi.\n"
"*This is an estimate only.\n"
"\n"
"Timeline: 54 Ceres days (equival. 6 days at origin).\n"
"\n"
