#. STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.LONELYMINION.KNOCK_KNOCK.TEXT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.LONELYMINION.KNOCK_KNOCK.TEXT"
