msgid ""
"My Duplicants found the survivor exploring the Abyss biome. She has been observing our machinery "
"and seems particularly intrigued by caviar.\n"
"\n"
"We have agreed to exchange {AMOUNT1} of caviar for {AMOUNT2} Gasket.\n"
"\n"
"I must enable delivery to guarantee its fulfilment."
msgstr ""
"Meus Duplicantes encontraram a sobrevivente explorando o bioma Abismo. Ela tem observado nosso "
"maquinário e parece particularmente intrigada com o caviar.\n"
"\n"
