msgid "Study {artifactCount} Terrestrial Artifacts at the Artifact Analysis Station"
msgstr "Estude {artifactCount} Artefatos Terrestres na Estação de Análise de Artefatos"

#. STRINGS.COLONY_ACHIEVEMENTS.STUDY_ARTIFACTS.REQUIREMENTS.STUDY_SPACE_ARTIFACTS
