#. STRINGS.CREATURES.PLANT_MUTATIONS.HEAVYFRUIT.DESCRIPTION
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.PLANT_MUTATIONS.HEAVYFRUIT.DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"Extra water in these plump mutant veggies causes them to fall right off the plant! There's no extra "
"nutritional value, though..."
msgstr ""
"Água extra nesses frutos mutantes suculentos faz com que eles caiam direto da planta! Infelizmente "
"não tem nenhum valor nutricional extra..."

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.PLANT_MUTATIONS.HEAVYFRUIT.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.PLANT_MUTATIONS.HEAVYFRUIT.NAME"
msgid "Juicy Fruits"
msgstr "Frutos Suculentos"

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.PLANT_MUTATIONS.LOADEDWITHFRUIT.DESCRIPTION
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.PLANT_MUTATIONS.LOADEDWITHFRUIT.DESCRIPTION"
msgid "This mutation produces lots of extra produce, though it also takes a long time to pick it all!"
msgstr ""
"Esta mutação produz bastante colheita extra, mas também isso faz com leve mais tempo para colher "
"tudo!"

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.PLANT_MUTATIONS.LOADEDWITHFRUIT.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.PLANT_MUTATIONS.LOADEDWITHFRUIT.NAME"
msgid "Bountiful"
msgstr "Abundante"

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.PLANT_MUTATIONS.MODERATELYLOOSE.DESCRIPTION
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.PLANT_MUTATIONS.MODERATELYLOOSE.DESCRIPTION"
msgid "Plants with this mutation are easier to take care of, but don't yield as much produce."
msgstr "Plantas com essa mutação são mais fáceis de cuidar, mas não produzem tanta colheita."

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.PLANT_MUTATIONS.MODERATELYLOOSE.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.PLANT_MUTATIONS.MODERATELYLOOSE.NAME"
msgid "Easygoing"
msgstr "Vagarosa"

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.PLANT_MUTATIONS.MODERATELYTIGHT.DESCRIPTION
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.PLANT_MUTATIONS.MODERATELYTIGHT.DESCRIPTION"
msgid "Plants with this mutation are pickier about their conditions but yield more produce."
msgstr "Plantas com esta mutação são mais exigentes quanto as suas condições mas produzem mais."

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.PLANT_MUTATIONS.MODERATELYTIGHT.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.PLANT_MUTATIONS.MODERATELYTIGHT.NAME"
msgid "Specialized"
msgstr "Especializado"

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.PLANT_MUTATIONS.NONE.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.PLANT_MUTATIONS.NONE.NAME"
msgid "Original"
msgstr "Original"

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.PLANT_MUTATIONS.PLANT_NAME_FMT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.PLANT_MUTATIONS.PLANT_NAME_FMT"
msgid "{PlantName} ({MutationList})"
msgstr "{PlantName} ({MutationList})"

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.PLANT_MUTATIONS.ROTTENHEAPS.DESCRIPTION
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.PLANT_MUTATIONS.ROTTENHEAPS.DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"Plants with this mutation grow extremely quickly, though the produce they make is sometimes "
"questionable."
msgstr ""
"Plantas com essa mutação crescem rapidamente, porém a colheita que elas produzem às vezes é "
"questionável."

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.PLANT_MUTATIONS.ROTTENHEAPS.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.PLANT_MUTATIONS.ROTTENHEAPS.NAME"
msgid "Exuberant"
msgstr "Exuberante"

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.PLANT_MUTATIONS.SLOWBURN.DESCRIPTION
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.PLANT_MUTATIONS.SLOWBURN.DESCRIPTION"
msgid "These plants grow almost as slow as their wild cousins, but also consume almost no fertilizer."
msgstr ""
"Estas plantas crescem tão lentamente quanto as suas primas selvagens, mas também consomem quase "
"nada de fertilizante."

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.PLANT_MUTATIONS.SLOWBURN.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.PLANT_MUTATIONS.SLOWBURN.NAME"
msgid "Wildish"
msgstr "Silvestre"

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.PLANT_MUTATIONS.SUNNYSPEED.DESCRIPTION
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.PLANT_MUTATIONS.SUNNYSPEED.DESCRIPTION"
msgid "This mutation provides the plant with sun-collecting leaves, allowing faster growth."
msgstr ""
"Esta mutação dá a planta folhas com a habilidade de coletar energia de luz solar, permitindo "
"crescimento rápido."

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.PLANT_MUTATIONS.SUNNYSPEED.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.PLANT_MUTATIONS.SUNNYSPEED.NAME"
msgid "Leafy"
msgstr "Frondosa"

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.PLANT_MUTATIONS.UNIDENTIFIED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.PLANT_MUTATIONS.UNIDENTIFIED"
msgid "Unidentified Subspecies"
msgstr "Subespécie Não Identificada"

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.PLANT_MUTATIONS.UNIDENTIFIED_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.PLANT_MUTATIONS.UNIDENTIFIED_DESC"
msgid ""
"This seed must be identified at the <link=\"GENETICANALYSISSTATION\">Botanical Analyzer</link> "
"before it can be planted."
msgstr ""
"Esta semente precisa ser identificada no <link=\"GENETICANALYSISSTATION\">Analisador Botânico</"
"link> antes de ser plantada."

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.POOP.PLANT_POOP_STATION_WILD
#| msgctxt "STRINGS.MISC.TAGS.FARMINGMATERIAL"
#| msgid "Fertilizer"
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.POOP.PLANT_POOP_STATION_WILD"
msgid "Fertilized"
msgstr "Fertilizada"

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.ALGAE_STEGO.BABY.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.ALGAE_STEGO.BABY.DESC"
msgid ""
"A slightly moist Blum Lumb baby.\n"
"\n"
"In time, it will grow into a stompy <link=\"ALGAESTEGO\">Blum Lumb</link>."
msgstr ""
"Um bebê Lombalguinho levemente úmido.\n"
"\n"
"Com o tempo, ele crescerá e se tornará um pisoteante <link=\"ALGAESTEGO\">Lombalgo</link>."

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.ALGAE_STEGO.BABY.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.ALGAE_STEGO.BABY.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"ALGAESTEGO\">Blumblet</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"ALGAESTEGO\">Lombalguinho</link>"

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.ALGAE_STEGO.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.ALGAE_STEGO.DESC"
msgid ""
"Blum Lumbs are non-hostile critters that produce <link=\"ALGAE\">Algae</link>.\n"
"\n"
"When they stomp heavily near <link=\"PLANTS\">plants</link>, the commotion causes harvestable items "
"to fall to the ground."
msgstr ""
"Lombalgos são criaturas não-hostis que produzem <link=\"ALGAE\">Alga</link>.\n"
"\n"
"Quando batem seus pés fortemente no chão perto das <link=\"PLANTS\">plantas</link>, toda essa "
"comoção faz com que os itens coletáveis caiam no chão."

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.ALGAE_STEGO.EGG_NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.ALGAE_STEGO.EGG_NAME"
msgid "<link=\"ALGAESTEGO\">Blum Lumb Egg</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"ALGAESTEGO\">Ovo de Lombalguinho</link>"

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.ALGAE_STEGO.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.ALGAE_STEGO.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"ALGAESTEGO\">Blum Lumb</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"ALGAESTEGO\">Lombalgo</link>"

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.BASICFABRICMATERIALPLANT.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.BASICFABRICMATERIALPLANT.DESC"
msgid ""
"Thimble Reeds produce indescribably soft <link=\"BASICFABRIC\">Reed Fiber</link> for "
"<link=\"EQUIPMENT\">Clothing</link> production."
msgstr ""
"Juncos produzem <link=\"BASICFABRIC\">Fibra de Caniço</link> indescritivelmente macia para a "
"produção de <link=\"EQUIPMENT\">Roupas</link>."

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.BASICFABRICMATERIALPLANT.DOMESTICATEDDESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.BASICFABRICMATERIALPLANT.DOMESTICATEDDESC"
msgid "This plant produces <link=\"BASICFABRIC\">Reed Fiber</link>."
msgstr "Esta planta produz <link=\"BASICFABRIC\">Fibra de Caniço</link>."

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.BASICFABRICMATERIALPLANT.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.BASICFABRICMATERIALPLANT.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"BASICFABRICPLANT\">Thimble Reed</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"BASICFABRICPLANT\">Caniço</link>"

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.BASICFORAGEPLANTPLANTED.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.BASICFORAGEPLANTPLANTED.DESC"
msgid ""
"Muckroots are incapable of propagating but can be harvested for a single <link=\"FOOD\">Food</link> "
"serving."
msgstr ""
"Raízes Terrosas são incapazes de reproduzir mas podem ser colhidos como uma única porção de "
"<link=\"FOOD\">Alimento</link>."

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.BASICFORAGEPLANTPLANTED.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.BASICFORAGEPLANTPLANTED.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"BASICFORAGEPLANTPLANTED\">Buried Muckroot</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"BASICFORAGEPLANTPLANTED\">Raiz Terrosa</link>"

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.BASICSINGLEHARVESTPLANT.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.BASICSINGLEHARVESTPLANT.DESC"
msgid ""
"Mealwoods produce <link=\"BASICPLANTFOOD\">Meal Lice</link>, an oddly wriggly grain that can be "
"harvested for <link=\"FOOD\">Food</link>."
msgstr ""
"Lárvores produzem <link=\"BASICPLANTFOOD\">Larvupim</link>, um grão estranhamente móvel que pode "
"ser colhido como fonte de <link=\"FOOD\">Alimento</link>."

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.BASICSINGLEHARVESTPLANT.DOMESTICATEDDESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.BASICSINGLEHARVESTPLANT.DOMESTICATEDDESC"
msgid "This plant produces edible <link=\"BASICPLANTFOOD\">Meal Lice</link>."
msgstr "Esta planta produz <link=\"BASICPLANTFOOD\">Larvupim</link>."

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.BASICSINGLEHARVESTPLANT.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.BASICSINGLEHARVESTPLANT.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"BASICSINGLEHARVESTPLANT\">Mealwood</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"BASICSINGLEHARVESTPLANT\">Lárvore</link>"

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.BEAN_PLANT.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.BEAN_PLANT.DESC"
msgid ""
"Nosh Sprouts thrive in colder climates and produce edible <link=\"BEANPLANTSEED\">Nosh Beans</link>."
msgstr ""
"Brotos Engolisos prosperam em climas mais frios e produzem <link=\"BEANPLANTSEED\">Feijões "
"Engolisos</link> comestíveis."

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.BEAN_PLANT.DOMESTICATEDDESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.BEAN_PLANT.DOMESTICATEDDESC"
msgid "This plant produces <link=\"BEANPLANTSEED\">Nosh Beans</link>."
msgstr "Esta planta produz <link=\"BEANPLANTSEED\">Feijões Engolisos</link>."

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.BEAN_PLANT.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.BEAN_PLANT.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"BEANPLANT\">Nosh Sprout</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"BEANPLANT\">Broto Engoliso</link>"

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.BEE.BABY.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.BEE.BABY.DESC"
msgid ""
"A harmless little Beetiny.\n"
"\n"
"In time, it will mature into a vicious adult <link=\"BEE\">Beeta</link>."
msgstr ""
"Uma pequena e inofensiva Abetinha.\n"
"\n"
"Com o tempo, ela vai formar uma perigosa <link=\"BEE\">Abeta</link> adulta."

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.BEE.BABY.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.BEE.BABY.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"BEE\">Beetiny</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"BEE\">Abetinha</link>"

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.BEE.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.BEE.DESC"
msgid ""
"Beetas are hostile critters that thrive in <link=\"RADIATION\">Radioactive</link> environments.\n"
"\n"
"They commonly gather <link=\"URANIUMORE\">Uranium Ore</link> for their <link=\"BEEHIVE\">Beeta "
"Hives</link> to produce <link=\"ENRICHEDURANIUM\">Enriched Uranium</link>."
msgstr ""
"As Abetas são criaturas hostis que prosperam em ambientes <link=\"RADIATION\">Radioativos</link>.\n"
"\n"
"Eles geralmente coletam <link=\"URANIUMORE\">Minério de Urânio</link> para suas "
"<link=\"BEEHIVE\">Colmeias de Abeta</link> para produzir <link=\"ENRICHEDURANIUM\">Urânio "
"Enriquecido</link>."

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.BEE.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.BEE.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"BEE\">Beeta</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"BEE\">Abeta</link>"

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.BLUE_GRASS.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.BLUE_GRASS.DESC"
msgid ""
"Alveo Veras consume <link=\"CARBONDIOXIDE\">Carbon Dioxide</link> and <link=\"ICE\">Ice</link>, and "
"form harvestable <link=\"OXYROCK\">Oxylite</link> deposits."
msgstr ""
"Alvéolo Vera consome <link=\"CARBONDIOXIDE\">Dióxido de Carbono</link> e <link=\"ICE\">Gelo</link> "
"e forma depósitos de <link=\"OXYROCK\">Oxilito</link> coletáveis."

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.BLUE_GRASS.DOMESTICATEDDESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.BLUE_GRASS.DOMESTICATEDDESC"
msgid "This plant produces <link=\"OXYROCK\">Oxylite</link>."
msgstr "Esta planta produz <link=\"OXYROCK\">Oxilito</link>."

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.BLUE_GRASS.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.BLUE_GRASS.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"BLUEGRASS\">Alveo Vera</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"BLUEGRASS\">Alvéolo Vera</link>"

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.BULBLOOM.DESC
#| msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.GLASSTILE.EFFECT"
#| msgid ""
#| "Used to build the walls and floors of rooms.\n"
#| "\n"
#| "Allows <link=\"LIGHT\">Light</link> and <link=\"DECOR\">Decor</link> to pass through."
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.BULBLOOM.DESC"
msgid ""
"Bulblooms emit a bioluminescent <link=\"LIGHT\">Light</link> that enhances <link=\"DECOR\">Decor</"
"link>."
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.BULBLOOM.DOMESTICATEDDESC
#| msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.EVILFLOWER.DOMESTICATEDDESC"
#| msgid ""
#| "This plant improves ambient <link=\"DECOR\">Decor</link> but produces high quantities of "
#| "<link=\"ZOMBIESPORES\">Zombie Spores</link>."
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.BULBLOOM.DOMESTICATEDDESC"
msgid ""
"This plant improves ambient <link=\"DECOR\">Decor</link> and produces <link=\"LIGHT\">Light</link>."
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.BULBLOOM.GROWTH_BONUS
#| msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.BULBPLANT.GROWTH_BONUS"
#| msgid "Growth Bonus"
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.BULBLOOM.GROWTH_BONUS"
msgid "Growth Bonus"
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.BULBLOOM.NAME
#| msgctxt "STRINGS.MISC.TAGS.ALLOY"
#| msgid "<link=\"ALLOY\">Alloy</link>"
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.BULBLOOM.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"BULBLOOM\">Bulbloom</link>"
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.BULBLOOM.WILT_PENALTY
#| msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.BULBPLANT.WILT_PENALTY"
#| msgid "Wilt Penalty"
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.BULBLOOM.WILT_PENALTY"
msgid "Wilt Penalty"
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.BULBPLANT.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.BULBPLANT.DESC"
msgid ""
"Buddy Buds are leafy plants that have a positive effect on <link=\"MORALE\">Morale</link>, much "
"like a friend."
msgstr ""
"Brotos Companheiros são plantas folhosas que possuem um efeito positivo na <link=\"MORALE\">Moral</"
"link>, bem parecido com um amigo."

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.BULBPLANT.DOMESTICATEDDESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.BULBPLANT.DOMESTICATEDDESC"
msgid "This plant improves ambient <link=\"DECOR\">Decor</link>."
msgstr "Esta planta melhora a <link=\"DECOR\">Decoração</link>."

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.BULBPLANT.GROWTH_BONUS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.BULBPLANT.GROWTH_BONUS"
msgid "Growth Bonus"
msgstr "Bônus de Crescimento"

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.BULBPLANT.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.BULBPLANT.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"BULBPLANT\">Buddy Bud</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"BULBPLANT\">Semente de Broto Companheiro</link>"

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.BULBPLANT.WILT_PENALTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.BULBPLANT.WILT_PENALTY"
msgid "Wilt Penalty"
msgstr "Penalidade por Murchar"

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.BUTTERFLY.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.BUTTERFLY.DESC"
msgid ""
"Mimikas are airborne organisms that help nearby <link=\"PLANTS\">Plants</link> grow more quickly.\n"
"\n"
"When its leaves dry up, it will harden into <link=\"BUTTERFLYPLANTSEED\">Mimillet</link>."
msgstr ""
"Florboletas são organismos aéreos que ajudam <link=\"PLANTS\">Plantas</link> próximas a crescer "
"mais rapidamente.\n"
"\n"
"Quando suas folhas se secam, ela endurece em uma <link=\"BUTTERFLYPLANTSEED\">Granoleta</link>."

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.BUTTERFLY.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.BUTTERFLY.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"BUTTERFLY\">Mimika</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"BUTTERFLY\">Florboleta</link>"

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.BUTTERFLYPLANT.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.BUTTERFLYPLANT.DESC"
msgid ""
"Mimika Buds are self-harvesting plants that produce airborne <link=\"BUTTERFLY\">Mimikas</link>.\n"
"\n"
"<link=\"BUTTERFLY\">Mimikas</link> boost growth for nearby <link=\"PLANTS\">Plants</link> before "
"hardening into <link=\"BUTTERFLYPLANTSEED\">Mimillet</link>."
msgstr ""
"Brotos de Florboleta são plantas auto-coletáveis que produzem <link=\"BUTTERFLY\">Florboletas</"
"link>.\n"
"\n"
"<link=\"BUTTERFLY\">Florboletas</link> melhoram o crescimento de <link=\"PLANTS\">Plantas</link> "
"próximas antes de endurecer e se tornar uma <link=\"BUTTERFLYPLANTSEED\">Granoleta</link>."

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.BUTTERFLYPLANT.DOMESTICATEDDESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.BUTTERFLYPLANT.DOMESTICATEDDESC"
msgid "This plant produces <link=\"BUTTERFLY\">Mimikas</link>."
msgstr "Esta planta produz <link=\"BUTTERFLY\">Florboletas</link>."

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.BUTTERFLYPLANT.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.BUTTERFLYPLANT.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"BUTTERFLYPLANT\">Mimika Bud</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"BUTTERFLYPLANT\">Broto de Florboleta</link>"

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.CACTUSPLANT.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.CACTUSPLANT.DESC"
msgid ""
"Joyas are <link=\"DECOR\">Decorative</link> <link=\"PLANTS\">Plants</link> that are colloquially "
"said to make gardeners \"jump for joy\"."
msgstr ""
"Cactos Alegres são <link=\"PLANTS\">Plantas</link> <link=\"DECOR\">Decorativas</link> que diz o "
"ditado, faz com que os jardineiros \"pulem de alegria\"."

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.CACTUSPLANT.DOMESTICATEDDESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.CACTUSPLANT.DOMESTICATEDDESC"
msgid "This plant improves ambient <link=\"DECOR\">Decor</link>."
msgstr "Esta planta melhora a <link=\"DECOR\">Decoração</link>."

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.CACTUSPLANT.GROWTH_BONUS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.CACTUSPLANT.GROWTH_BONUS"
msgid "Growth Bonus"
msgstr "Bônus de Crescimento"

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.CACTUSPLANT.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.CACTUSPLANT.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"CACTUSPLANT\">Jumping Joya</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"CACTUSPLANT\">Cacto Alegre</link>"

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.CACTUSPLANT.WILT_PENALTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.CACTUSPLANT.WILT_PENALTY"
msgid "Wilt Penalty"
msgstr "Penalidade por Murchar"

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.CARROTPLANT.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.CARROTPLANT.DESC"
msgid ""
"Plume Squashes are sweet, nutrient-rich tubers that can be harvested for <link=\"FOOD\">Food</link>."
msgstr ""
"Batatas-Pluma são tubérculos doces e ricos em nutrientes que podem ser colhidos para "
"<link=\"FOOD\">Alimento</link>."

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.CARROTPLANT.DOMESTICATEDDESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.CARROTPLANT.DOMESTICATEDDESC"
msgid "This plant produces edible <link=\"CARROT\">Plume Squash</link>."
msgstr "Esta planta produz <link=\"CARROT\">Batata-Pluma</link> comestível."

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.CARROTPLANT.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.CARROTPLANT.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"CARROTPLANT\">Plume Squash Plant</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"CARROTPLANT\">Planta de Batata-Pluma</link>"

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.CHAMELEON.BABY.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.CHAMELEON.BABY.DESC"
msgid ""
"A wide-eyed little Dartlet.\n"
"\n"
"Someday it will mature into a fully grown <link=\"CHAMELEON\">Dartle</link>."
msgstr ""
"Um pequeno Camalentinho de olhos esbugalhados.\n"
"\n"
"Com o tempo ele vai crescer formando um <link=\"CHAMELEON\">Camalentão</link>."

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.CHAMELEON.BABY.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.CHAMELEON.BABY.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"CHAMELEON\">Dartlet</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"CHAMELEON\">Camalentinho</link>"

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.CHAMELEON.DESC
#| msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.CHAMELEON.DESC"
#| msgid ""
#| "Dartles are non-hostile critters who eat <link=\"DEWDRIP\">Dewdrips</link> and excrete "
#| "<link=\"BLEACHSTONE\">Bleach Stone</link> and <link=\"CHLORINEGAS\">Chlorine Gas</link> .\n"
#| "\n"
#| "They are preyed on by <link=\"RAPTOR\">Rhexes</link>."
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.CHAMELEON.DESC"
msgid ""
"Dartles are non-hostile critters who eat <link=\"DEWDRIP\">Dewdrips</link> and excrete "
"<link=\"BLEACHSTONE\">Bleach Stone</link> and <link=\"CHLORINEGAS\">Chlorine Gas</link>.\n"
"\n"
"They are preyed on by <link=\"RAPTOR\">Rhexes</link>."
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.CHAMELEON.EGG_NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.CHAMELEON.EGG_NAME"
msgid "<link=\"CHAMELEON\">Dartle Egg</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"CHAMELEON\">Ovo de Camalentinho</link>"

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.CHAMELEON.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.CHAMELEON.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"CHAMELEON\">Dartle</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"CHAMELEON\">Camalentão</link>"

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.CHLORINEGEYSER.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.CHLORINEGEYSER.DESC"
msgid ""
"A highly pressurized geyser that periodically erupts with <link=\"CHLORINEGAS\">Chlorine Gas</link>."
msgstr ""
"Um gêiser altamente pressurizado que periodicamente entra em erupção com <link=\"CHLORINEGAS\">Gás "
"Cloro</link>."

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.CHLORINEGEYSER.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.CHLORINEGEYSER.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"GEYSERGENERICCHLORINEGAS\">Chlorine Geyser</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"GEYSERGENERICCHLORINEGAS\">Gêiser de Cloro</link>"

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.CLAM.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.CLAM.DESC"
msgid ""
"Clampums are aquatic bivalves that transform <link=\"SAND\">Sand</link> into <link=\"PEARL\">Pearl</"
"link>.\n"
"\n"
"Due to their size, they can only be planted in a <link=\"WIDEFARMTILE\">Wide Hydroponic Farm</link>."
msgstr ""
"Mordi-Pérolas são bivalves aquáticas que transformam <link=\"SAND\">Areia</link> em "
"<link=\"PEARL\">Pérola</link>.\n"
"\n"
"Devido a seu tamanho, elas podem apenas ser plantadas em uma <link=\"WIDEFARMTILE\">Horta "
"Hidropônica Larga</link>."

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.CLAM.DOMESTICATEDDESC
#| msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.BUTTERFLYPLANT.DOMESTICATEDDESC"
#| msgid "This plant produces <link=\"BUTTERFLY\">Mimikas</link>."
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.CLAM.DOMESTICATEDDESC"
msgid "This organism produces <link=\"PEARL\">Pearl</link>."
msgstr "Esse organismo produz <link=\"PEARL\">Pérolas</link>."

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.CLAM.NAME
#| msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.CLAY.NAME"
#| msgid "<link=\"CLAY\">Clay</link>"
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.CLAM.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"CLAM\">Clampum</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"CLAM\">Mordi-Pérola</link>"

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.COLDBREATHER.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.COLDBREATHER.DESC"
msgid ""
"Wheezeworts can be planted in <link=\"PLANTERBOX\">Planter Boxes</link>, <link=\"FARMTILE\">Farm "
"Tiles</link> or <link=\"HYDROPONICFARM\">Hydroponic Farms</link>, and absorb <link=\"HEAT\">Heat</"
"link> by respiring through their porous outer membranes."
msgstr ""
"Ervas Chia-Frio podem ser cultivadas em <link=\"PLANTERBOX\">Jardineiras</link>, "
"<link=\"FARMTILE\">Blocos de Horta</link> ou <link=\"HYDROPONICFARM\">Hortas Hidropônicas</link>, e "
"absorvem <link=\"HEAT\">Calor</link> ao respirar por sua membrana externa porosa."

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.COLDBREATHER.DOMESTICATEDDESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.COLDBREATHER.DOMESTICATEDDESC"
msgid "This plant absorbs <link=\"HEAT\">Heat</link>."
msgstr "Esta planta absorve <link=\"HEAT\">Calor</link>."

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.COLDBREATHER.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.COLDBREATHER.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"COLDBREATHER\">Wheezewort</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"COLDBREATHER\">Erva Chia-Frio</link>"

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.COLDBREATHERCLUSTER.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.COLDBREATHERCLUSTER.DESC"
msgid ""
"Wheezeworts can be planted in <link=\"PLANTERBOX\">Planter Boxes</link>, <link=\"FARMTILE\">Farm "
"Tiles</link> or <link=\"HYDROPONICFARM\">Hydroponic Farms</link>, and absorb <link=\"HEAT\">Heat</"
"link> by respiring through their porous outer membranes."
msgstr ""
"Ervas Chia-Frio podem ser cultivadas em <link=\"PLANTERBOX\">Jardineiras</link>, "
"<link=\"FARMTILE\">Blocos de Horta</link> ou <link=\"HYDROPONICFARM\">Hortas Hidropônicas</link>, e "
"absorvem <link=\"HEAT\">Calor</link> ao respirar por sua membrana externa porosa."

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.COLDBREATHERCLUSTER.DOMESTICATEDDESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.COLDBREATHERCLUSTER.DOMESTICATEDDESC"
msgid "This plant absorbs <link=\"HEAT\">Heat</link>."
msgstr "Esta planta absorve <link=\"HEAT\">Calor</link>."

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.COLDBREATHERCLUSTER.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.COLDBREATHERCLUSTER.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"COLDBREATHERCLUSTER\">Wheezewort</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"COLDBREATHERCLUSTER\">Erva Chia-Frio</link>"

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.COLDWHEAT.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.COLDWHEAT.DESC"
msgid ""
"Sleet Wheat produces <link=\"COLDWHEATSEED\">Sleet Wheat Grain</link>, a chilly grain that can be "
"processed into <link=\"FOOD\">Food</link>."
msgstr ""
"Trigo de Granizo produz <link=\"COLDWHEATSEED\">Grãos de Trigo de Granizo</link>, um grão fresco "
"que pode ser processado em <link=\"FOOD\">Alimento</link>."

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.COLDWHEAT.DOMESTICATEDDESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.COLDWHEAT.DOMESTICATEDDESC"
msgid "This plant produces edible <link=\"COLDWHEATSEED\">Sleet Wheat Grain</link>."
msgstr "Esta planta produz <link=\"COLDWHEATSEED\">Grãos de Trigo de Granizo</link> comestíveis."

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.COLDWHEAT.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.COLDWHEAT.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"COLDWHEAT\">Sleet Wheat</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"COLDWHEAT\">Trigo de Granizo</link>"

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.CRAB.BABY.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.CRAB.BABY.DESC"
msgid ""
"A snippy little Pokeshell Spawn.\n"
"\n"
"In time it will mature into a fully grown <link=\"CRAB\">Pokeshell</link>."
msgstr ""
"Um pequeno e beliscudo Socasquinho.\n"
"\n"
"Com o tempo ele vai crescer formando um <link=\"CRAB\">Socasco</link>."

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.CRAB.BABY.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.CRAB.BABY.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"CRAB\">Pokeshell Spawn</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"CRAB\">Socasquinho</link>"

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.CRAB.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.CRAB.DESC"
msgid ""
"Pokeshells are nonhostile critters unless their eggs are nearby.\n"
"\n"
"They eat <link=\"TOXICSAND\">Polluted Dirt</link> and <link=\"COMPOST\">Rot Piles</link>.\n"
"\n"
"The shells they leave behind after molting can be crushed into <link=\"LIME\">Lime</link>."
msgstr ""
"Socascos são criaturas pacíficas, a menos que seus ovos estejam por perto.\n"
"\n"
"Eles comem <link=\"TOXICSAND\">Terra Poluída</link> e <link=\"COMPOST\">Pilhas Podres</link>.\n"
"\n"
"As cascas que deixam após a ecdise podem ser transformadas em <link=\"LIME\">Cal</link>."

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.CRAB.EGG_NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.CRAB.EGG_NAME"
msgid "<link=\"CRAB\">Pokeshell Roe</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"CRAB\">Ova de Socasco</link>"

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.CRAB.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.CRAB.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"CRAB\">Pokeshell</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"CRAB\">Socasco</link>"

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.CRAB.VARIANT_FRESH_WATER.BABY.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.CRAB.VARIANT_FRESH_WATER.BABY.DESC"
msgid ""
"A picky little Sanishell Spawn.\n"
"\n"
"In time it will mature into a fully grown <link=\"CRABFRESHWATER\">Sanishell</link>."
msgstr ""
"Um pequeno e exigente Limpasquinho.\n"
"\n"
"Com o tempo ele vai crescer formando um <link=\"CRABFRESHWATER\">Limpasco</link>."

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.CRAB.VARIANT_FRESH_WATER.BABY.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.CRAB.VARIANT_FRESH_WATER.BABY.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"CRABFRESHWATER\">Sanishell Spawn</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"CRABFRESHWATER\">Limpasquinho</link>"

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.CRAB.VARIANT_FRESH_WATER.DESC
#| msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.CRAB.VARIANT_FRESH_WATER.DESC"
#| msgid ""
#| "Sanishells are nonhostile critters unless their eggs are nearby.\n"
#| "\n"
#| "They thrive in <link=\"WATER\">Water</link> and eliminate <link=\"DISEASE\">Germs</link> from "
#| "any liquid it inhabits.\n"
#| "\n"
#| "They eat <link=\"TOXICSAND\">Polluted Dirt</link>, <link=\"SLIMEMOLD\">Slime</link> and "
#| "<link=\"COMPOST\">Rot Piles</link>."
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.CRAB.VARIANT_FRESH_WATER.DESC"
msgid ""
"Sanishells are nonhostile critters unless their eggs are nearby.\n"
"\n"
"They thrive in <link=\"WATER\">Water</link> and eliminate <link=\"DISEASE\">Germs</link> from any "
"liquid they inhabit.\n"
"\n"
"They eat <link=\"TOXICSAND\">Polluted Dirt</link>, <link=\"SLIMEMOLD\">Slime</link> and "
"<link=\"COMPOST\">Rot Piles</link>."
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.CRAB.VARIANT_FRESH_WATER.EGG_NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.CRAB.VARIANT_FRESH_WATER.EGG_NAME"
msgid "<link=\"CRABFRESHWATER\">Sanishell Roe</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"CRABFRESHWATER\">Ova de Limpasco</link>"

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.CRAB.VARIANT_FRESH_WATER.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.CRAB.VARIANT_FRESH_WATER.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"CRABFRESHWATER\">Sanishell</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"CRABFRESHWATER\">Limpasco</link>"

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.CRAB.VARIANT_WOOD.BABY.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.CRAB.VARIANT_WOOD.BABY.DESC"
msgid ""
"A knotty little Oakshell Spawn.\n"
"\n"
"In time it will mature into a fully grown <link=\"CRABWOOD\">Oakshell</link>."
msgstr ""
"Um pequeno e enrolado Carvalhasquinho.\n"
"\n"
"Com o tempo ele vai crescer formando um <link=\"CRABWOOD\">Carvalhasco</link>."

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.CRAB.VARIANT_WOOD.BABY.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.CRAB.VARIANT_WOOD.BABY.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"CRABWOOD\">Oakshell Spawn</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"CRABWOOD\">Carvalhasquinho</link>"

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.CRAB.VARIANT_WOOD.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.CRAB.VARIANT_WOOD.DESC"
msgid ""
"Oakshells are nonhostile critters unless their eggs are nearby.\n"
"\n"
"They eat <link=\"TOXICSAND\">Polluted Dirt</link>, <link=\"SLIMEMOLD\">Slime</link> and "
"<link=\"COMPOST\">Rot Piles</link>.\n"
"\n"
"The shells they leave behind after molting can be crushed into <link=\"WOOD\">Wood</link>.\n"
"\n"
"Oakshells thrive in <link=\"ETHANOL\">Ethanol</link>."
msgstr ""
"Carvalhascos são criaturas pacíficas, a menos que seus ovos estejam por perto.\n"
"\n"
"Eles comem <link=\"TOXICSAND\">Terra Poluída</link>, <link=\"SLIMEMOLD\">Limo</link> e "
"<link=\"COMPOST\">Pilhas Podres</link>.\n"
"\n"
"As cascas que eles deixam para trás após a ecdise podem ser esmagadas para obter "
"<link=\"WOOD\">Madeira</link>.\n"
"\n"
"Carvalhascos vivem em <link=\"ETHANOL\">Etanol</link>."

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.CRAB.VARIANT_WOOD.EGG_NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.CRAB.VARIANT_WOOD.EGG_NAME"
msgid "<link=\"CRABWOOD\">Oakshell Roe</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"CRABWOOD\">Ova de Carvalhasco</link>"

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.CRAB.VARIANT_WOOD.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.CRAB.VARIANT_WOOD.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"CRABWOOD\">Oakshell</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"CRABWOOD\">Carvalhasco</link>"

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.CRITTERTRAPPLANT.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.CRITTERTRAPPLANT.DESC"
msgid ""
"Critter Traps are carnivorous plants that consume small-to-medium-sized critters and release "
"<link=\"HYDROGEN\">Hydrogen Gas</link> as waste."
msgstr ""
"Carniplantas são plantas carnívoras que capturam criaturas descuidadas e as consomem, liberando "
"<link=\"HYDROGEN\">Hidrogênio</link> como resíduo."

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.CRITTERTRAPPLANT.DOMESTICATEDDESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.CRITTERTRAPPLANT.DOMESTICATEDDESC"
msgid "This plant eats small critters and produces <link=\"HYDROGEN\">Hydrogen Gas</link>."
msgstr "Esta planta come criaturas e produz <link=\"HYDROGEN\">Hidrogênio</link>."

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.CRITTERTRAPPLANT.HUNGRY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.CRITTERTRAPPLANT.HUNGRY"
msgid "Hungry"
msgstr "Faminta"

