#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.ICEBELLY.BABY.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.ICEBELLY.BABY.DESC"
msgid ""
"A floofy little Bammini.\n"
"\n"
"In time it will mature into a fully grown <link=\"ICEBELLY\">Bammoth</link>."
msgstr ""
"Um pequeno Minimute fofo.\n"
"\n"
"Com o tempo, ele amadurecerá e se tornará um <link=\"ICEBELLY\">Bamute</link> totalmente crescido."

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.ICEBELLY.BABY.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.ICEBELLY.BABY.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"ICEBELLY\">Bammini</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"ICEBELLY\">Minimute</link>"

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.ICEBELLY.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.ICEBELLY.DESC"
msgid ""
"Bammoths are lumbering, nonhostile creatures that subsist on <link=\"CARROT\">Plume Squash</link>, "
"<link=\"BEANPLANTSEED\">Nosh Beans</link> and <link=\"FRIESCARROT\">Squash Fries</link>.\n"
"\n"
"Their thick overcoats can be shorn for <link=\"BASICFABRIC\">Reed Fiber</link>."
msgstr ""
"Bamutes são criaturas pesadas e não-hostis que subsistem de <link=\"CARROT\">Batata de Pluma</"
"link>, <link=\"BEANPLANTSEED\">Feijões Engolisos</link> e <link=\"FRIESCARROT\">Batatas Fritas</"
"link> .\n"
"\n"
"Sua pelagem grossa pode ser tosquiada para obter <link=\"BASICFABRIC\">Fibra de Caniço</link>."

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.ICEBELLY.EGG_NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.ICEBELLY.EGG_NAME"
msgid "<link=\"ICEBELLY\">Bammoth Egg</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"ICEBELLY\">Ovo de Bamute</link>"

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.ICEBELLY.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.ICEBELLY.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"ICEBELLY\">Bammoth</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"ICEBELLY\">Bamute</link>"

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.ICEBELLY.VARIANT_GOLD.BABY.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.ICEBELLY.VARIANT_GOLD.BABY.DESC"
msgid ""
"A haughty little Regal Bammini.\n"
"\n"
"In time it will mature into a fully grown <link=\"GOLDBELLY\">Regal Bammoth</link>."
msgstr ""
"Um pequeno e arrogante Minimute Real.\n"
"\n"
"Com o tempo, ele amadurecerá e se tornará um <link=\"GOLDBELLY\">Bamute Real</link> totalmente "
"crescido."

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.ICEBELLY.VARIANT_GOLD.BABY.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.ICEBELLY.VARIANT_GOLD.BABY.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"GOLDBELLY\">Regal Bammini</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"GOLDBELLY\">Minimute Real</link>"

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.ICEBELLY.VARIANT_GOLD.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.ICEBELLY.VARIANT_GOLD.DESC"
msgid ""
"Regal Bammoths are nonhostile creatures that subsist on <link=\"CARROT\">Plume Squash</link> and "
"<link=\"BEANPLANTSEED\">Nosh Beans</link>.\n"
"\n"
"Their ornate crests grow only when they are fed <link=\"FRIESCARROT\">Squash Fries</link>."
msgstr ""
"Bamutes Reais são criaturas não-hostis que subsistem de <link=\"CARROT\">Batata de Pluma</link> e "
"<link=\"BEANPLANTSEED\">Feijões Engoliso</link>.\n"
"\n"
"Suas cristas ornamentadas crescem apenas quando são alimentados com <link=\"FRIESCARROT\">Batatas "
"Fritas</link>."

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.ICEBELLY.VARIANT_GOLD.EGG_NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.ICEBELLY.VARIANT_GOLD.EGG_NAME"
