#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.LIGHTBUG.VARIANT_BLACK.BABY.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.LIGHTBUG.VARIANT_BLACK.BABY.DESC"
msgid ""
"A chubby baby <link=\"LIGHTBUGBLACK\">Shine Bug</link>.\n"
"\n"
"This one is an Abyss morph."
msgstr ""
"Um bebê <link=\"LIGHTBUGBLACK\">Vagalume</link> gordinho.\n"
"\n"
"Este aqui é da raça Abissal."

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.LIGHTBUG.VARIANT_BLACK.BABY.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.LIGHTBUG.VARIANT_BLACK.BABY.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"LIGHTBUGBLACK\">Abyss Nymph</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"LIGHTBUGBLACK\">Vagaluminho Abissal</link>"

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.LIGHTBUG.VARIANT_BLACK.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.LIGHTBUG.VARIANT_BLACK.DESC"
msgid ""
"This Shine Bug emits no <link=\"LIGHT\">Light</link>, but it makes up for it by having an excellent "
"personality.\n"
"\n"
"Their eggs contain small amounts of <link=\"NATURALRESIN\">Resin</link> that can be harvested when "
"cracked at the <link=\"EGGCRACKER\">Egg Cracker</link>."
msgstr ""
"Este Vagalume não emite <link=\"LIGHT\">Luz</link>, mas ele compensa isso tendo uma personalidade "
"excelente.\n"
"\n"
"Seus ovos contem pequenas quantidades de <link=\"NATURALRESIN\">Resina</link> que pode ser colhida "
"quando ele for quebrado no <link=\"EGGCRACKER\">Quebrador de Ovos</link>."

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.LIGHTBUG.VARIANT_BLACK.EGG_NAME
