#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.MOO.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.MOO.DESC"
msgid ""
"Moos are extraterrestrial critters that feed on <link=\"GASGRASS\">Gas Grass</link> and excrete "
"<link=\"METHANE\">Natural Gas</link>.\n"
"\n"
"When domesticated and fed, they can be milked for <link=\"MILK\">Brackene</link>."
msgstr ""
"Muus são criaturas extraterrestres que se alimentam de <link=\"GASGRASS\">Grama Gasosa</link> e "
"excretam <link=\"METHANE\">Gás Natural</link>.\n"
"\n"
"Quando domesticados e alimentados, eles podem ser ordenhados para obter <link=\"MILK\">Leite Muu</"
"link>."

