msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.PACU.VARIANT_CLEANER.DESC"
msgid ""
"Gulp Fishes are aquatic critters who inhabit cold liquid pools.\n"
"\n"
"Their gills filter <link=\"DIRTYWATER\">Polluted Water</link> into <link=\"WATER\">Water</link>."
msgstr ""
"Peixinhos das Neves são criaturas aquáticas que habitam piscinas de líquido frios.\n"
"\n"
"Suas guelras filtram <link=\"DIRTYWATER\">Água Poluída</link> em <link=\"WATER\">Água</link>."

