#| "In time, it will mature into an adult <link=\"PACU\">Pacu</link>."
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.PUFFERFISH.BABY.DESC"
msgid ""
"A precious little Blowter Fry.\n"
"\n"
"In time, it will mature into an adult <link=\"PUFFERFISH\">Blowter</link>."
msgstr ""
"Um pequeno e precioso Bóiaquinho.\n"
"\n"
"Com o tempo, ele amadurecerá em um <link=\"PUFFERFISH\">Bóiacu</link> adulto."

