#| "In time, it will mature into an adult <link=\"PACU\">Pacu</link>."
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.SEAHORSE.BABY.DESC"
msgid ""
"A flouncy little Seaquine Fry.\n"
"\n"
"In time, it will mature into an adult <link=\"SEAHORSE\">Seaquine</link>."
msgstr ""
"Uma pequena e flutuante Maréguinha.\n"
"\n"
"Com o tempo, ela amadurecerá em uma <link=\"SEAHORSE\">Marégua</link> adulta."

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.SEAHORSE.BABY.NAME
