msgstr "Claustrofóbico"

#. STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.TRAITS.NEEDS.CLIMACOPHOBIC.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.TRAITS.NEEDS.CLIMACOPHOBIC.DESC"
