#. STRINGS.ELEMENTS.SOLIDOXYGEN.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.SOLIDOXYGEN.DESC"
msgid ""
"(O<sub>2</sub>) Solid Oxygen is a breathable element in a <link=\"ELEMENTSSOLID\">Solid</link> "
