#. STRINGS.MISC.TAGS.BUILDINGGASKET_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.MISC.TAGS.BUILDINGGASKET_DESC"
msgid ""
"Gaskets are mechanical seals made from <link=\"RUBBER\">Rubber</link> or <link=\"PLASTIC\">Plastic</"
"link> at the <link=\"CRAFTINGTABLE\">Crafting Station</link>.\n"
"\n"
"They are essential components for certain buildings and objects that require a strong "
"<link=\"ELEMENTSLIQUID\">Liquid</link> seal."
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.MISC.TAGS.BUILDINGWOOD
msgctxt "STRINGS.MISC.TAGS.BUILDINGWOOD"
msgid "<link=\"BUILDINGWOOD\">Wood</link>"
msgstr "<<link=\"BUILDINGWOOD\">Madeira</link>"

#. STRINGS.MISC.TAGS.BUILDINGWOOD_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.MISC.TAGS.BUILDINGWOOD_DESC"
msgid ""
"Wood is a renewable building material which can also be used as a valuable source of fuel and "
"electricity when refined at the <link=\"WOODGASGENERATOR\">Wood Burner</link> or the "
"<link=\"ETHANOLDISTILLERY\">Ethanol Distiller</link>."
msgstr ""
"A madeira é um material de construção renovável que também pode ser usado como uma valiosa fonte de "
"combustível e eletricidade quando refinado no <link=\"WOODGASGENERATOR\">Incinerador de Lenha</"
"link> ou no <link=\"ETHANOLDISTILLERY\">Destilador de Etanol</link >."

