"An automated sweeping robot.\n"
"\n"
"Sweeps up <link=\"ELEMENTSSOLID\">Solid</link> debris and <link=\"ELEMENTSLIQUID\">Liquid</link> "
"spills and stores the material back in its <link=\"SWEEPBOTSTATION\">Sweepy Dock</link>."
msgstr ""
