#. STRINGS.UI.SPACEDESTINATIONS.ARTIFACT_POI.GRAVITASSPACESTATION5.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.SPACEDESTINATIONS.ARTIFACT_POI.GRAVITASSPACESTATION5.NAME"
